& 4+(-3)(2)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & ∼\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Applying Row Operations To an Augmented Matrix"}]}
